// Atlas fork — recommended user-settings block (TEMPLATE, not a default).
//
// PRD hard rule: stock Zed stays pixel-identical with the agent flags off, so
// the fork does NOT touch assets/settings/default.json. The M0–M2 workspace-
// mode templates (.agents/modes/*.json) carry layout specs only — they have no
// settings-overlay field, and M2 explicitly rejected settings.json writes on
// mode switch as too invasive. Fonts (and the Atlas OLED theme) therefore ship
// as this copy-paste template instead of a default.
//
// Nothing in the binary loads this file; it is documentation. Merge the block
// below into your user settings (`zed: open settings file`):
{
  "theme": "Atlas OLED",
  "ui_font_family": "Inter",
  "buffer_font_family": "JetBrains Mono"
}
